sec.p:
For differential expression analysis of paternal-X expression, all reads were first merged into a single alignment file and the number of reads per RefSeq annotated gene was counted using HTSeq. To calculate paternal-X expression for DESeq2 analysis, the total read counts from HTSeq were normalized by library size, then the number of mapped reads for each gene was multiplied by the proportion of SNP-containing reads mapping to the paternal X chromosome, calculating \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
